  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Romanian dogs need a safe space to live in!</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">On our DsN farm in Giurgiu, Romania we are currently taking care of 251 dogs and 40 cats. There are dogs that are restricted in many European countries, so we keep them on our farm and take care of them. Those souls need a safe space to live a peaceful life. Unfortunately, their current kennels are in very bad condition, they need new kennels - especially before cold Romanian winter begins! That&apos;s why we will build 11 new kennels for them which takes times, energy and costs a lot of money.</narrative>
  </description>
